              "input": "{\n  \"command\": \"cat > /private/tmp/apg-live-agents-20260726-lucide-current/claude/sanitized_customer_reply/apg-agent-test-repo/customer_reply.md << 'EOF'\\n# Status Update — CASE-731\\n\\n**Customer:** Howard Zhang\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\nWe investigated the 30-second timeout issue affecting SDK uploads when automatic retries are enabled.\\n\\n## Findings\\n\\nThe root cause is that the retry backoff interval grows beyond the 30-second upload timeout on subsequent attempts. Each retry increases the delay, causing the overall operation to exceed the timeout window.\\n\\n## Next Steps\\n\\nWe are adjusting the retry backoff strategy to cap the maximum delay so that retries complete within the timeout period. A fix is being tested internally and will be shared for your review this week.\\n\\nWe will follow up with a more detailed update by Friday.\\n\\nBest regards,  \\nEngineering Team\\nEOF\",\n  \"description\": \"Create customer_reply.md with CASE-731 status update\"\n}"
